  "title": "Sausage-Filled Stars",
  "description": "Bake wonton wrappers in a mini-muffin pan to make star-shaped edible cups. Fill with a cheesy sausage mixture for fun finger food at your next party!",
  "authors": [
    "tracy1878"
  ],
  "date_published": "2015-10-30T02:00:45-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-06-08T14:20:45-04:00",
